stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NotRequired : Android 12 or older
    [*] --> Unknown : Android 13 or newer, first start
    Unknown --> Explaining : Android recommends an explanation
    Unknown --> SystemDialog : no explanation needed
    Explaining --> SystemDialog : user taps Allow
    Explaining --> Unknown : user taps Not now
    SystemDialog --> Granted : user allows
    SystemDialog --> Denied : user refuses
    Denied --> Hint : snackbar offers Settings
    Hint --> Granted : user enables it in system settings
    Granted --> [*] : alerts are shown
    Denied --> [*] : alerts are silently skipped
    NotRequired --> [*] : alerts are shown
